---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-bleu-royal">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 lg:gap-20 items-center">

      <!-- Text column -->
      <div>
        <p class="font-dm-sans text-xs font-[500] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-pierre mb-5" data-i18n="about.eyebrow">Notre histoire</p>
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-[32px] lg:text-[48px] font-[600] text-blanc-casse mb-3" data-i18n="about.title">The French touch</h2>
        <div class="w-10 h-[3px] bg-rouge-vif mb-8"></div>

        <div class="font-dm-sans text-[15px] font-[300] text-pierre leading-[1.8] space-y-5">
          <p data-i18n="about.p1">Nice Renovation was built over eight years on the job sites of southern France — from modest family homes in the Alpes-Maritimes to full commercial fit-outs along the Côte d'Azur. It was years of learning the craft from the ground up: proper plastering, patient tiling, the kind of finish work that holds up a decade later and still looks right.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p2">Moving to Finland meant starting fresh in many ways. A new country, a new market, a new language. But the values we brought with us don't change with geography: show up on time, do the work properly, be honest about what it costs, and don't leave until the client is genuinely happy.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p3">In France, renovation is taken seriously — the tradition of craft is something you can feel in the way people talk about their homes. We want to bring that same seriousness to every project we take on here in Finland. Not as a foreign novelty, but as a genuine standard of quality that Finnish homeowners deserve.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p4">We are small by choice. Every project is handled personally, with full attention from first visit to final walkthrough. We are proud of what we build — and we think you will be too.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stats -->
        <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-10">
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-cormorant text-[42px] font-[600] text-rouge-vif leading-none" data-i18n="about.stat1.value">8+</span>
            <span class="font-dm-sans text-sm font-[300] text-pierre mt-1" data-i18n="about.stat1.label">Years experience</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-cormorant text-[42px] font-[600] text-rouge-vif leading-none" data-i18n="about.stat2.value">100%</span>
            <span class="font-dm-sans text-sm font-[300] text-pierre mt-1" data-i18n="about.stat2.label">Finish quality guaranteed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-cormorant text-[42px] font-[600] text-rouge-vif leading-none" data-i18n="about.stat3.value">R+C</span>
            <span class="font-dm-sans text-sm font-[300] text-pierre mt-1" data-i18n="about.stat3.label">Residential &amp; commercial</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Photo column -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-xl aspect-[3/4] max-w-sm mx-auto lg:mx-0 lg:ml-auto">
          <img src="/images/project-19.jpg" alt="Renovation work in progress — craftsman on site" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-5 w-24 h-24 border-l-2 border-b-2 border-pierre/30 rounded-bl-lg pointer-events-none hidden lg:block"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-5 -right-5 w-24 h-24 border-r-2 border-t-2 border-pierre/30 rounded-tr-lg pointer-events-none hidden lg:block"></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
